  "tail_formula": "T = P(W >= WMAX+1) where W = sum of independent Bernoulli(p_i) over all mechanisms; computed exactly by Poisson-binomial dynamic programming in exact rational arithmetic.",
  "lower_bound_formula": "L = sum over uncorrectable F, 1<=|F|<=WMAX, of prod_{i in F} p_i * prod_{j not in F} (1-p_j); accumulated exactly as SUMINT/D with D = prod_j p_den_j."
